  "street_ambience": null,
  "evening_birds": null,
  "party_murmur": null,
  "rooms_why": "Silent on purpose: under continuous narration and a music bed, room tones only add mud; the cartoon world is clean. The party murmur is out for the reason sound.md gives (crowd walla read as chanting). The bird at the window is its own cue."
